== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Knockout Drops|Knockout Drops]] is from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', enemies would not take extra damage from being knocked into something else but still deal damage to enemies they are knocked into.
* Taking this item as {{C|Keeper}} will give him the expression of Bum-Bo the Brave, and by extension, {{E|Bumbino}}.

